<div class="source-doc-poem">
  <p>My heart is composed of a number of rooms<br>
  Where my friends and loved ones stay,<br>
  But over one room a dark cloud looms<br>
  For one tenant has gone away.<br>
  I will always remember the days before<br>
  All my happiness turned to gloom,<br>
  My love is gone and I'll close the door<br>
  On that cold, dark, empty room<br>
  I found no one to take his place<br>
  Of course, that could never be<br>
  Always before me is his dear face<br>
  And no other love can I see</p>
</div>
